@startuml
actor Operator as Op
participant "MES FE" as FE
participant "MES API" as API
participant "MES DB" as DB
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ

Op -> FE : Нажать «Взять в работу»
FE -> API : POST /orders/{id}/start
API -> DB : UPDATE orders SET status='MANUFACTURING_STARTED' WHERE id=...
DB --> API : OK (commit)
API -> MQ : publish OrderStatusChanged(orderId, old, new)
API -> Cache : DEL orders:detail:{id}
API -> Cache : Invalidate lists по old/new статусам (по наборам ключей)
API --> FE : 200 OK (новый статус)
@enduml